# Agent skills (npx skills). The payload is restorable from skills-lock.json
# via `npx skills update`, so only the lockfile is tracked — same model as
# node_modules. .claude/skills holds symlinks into .agents, which would not
# survive a Windows checkout anyway.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
